      "id": "claim_a3185358ac5d4f75877b6d39ea5cbfac",
      "statement": "Agent trace addressing requires an identifier and environment together: explicit code configuration takes precedence, environment variables are used only when neither code destination is supplied, and a partial variable pair warns and leaves otherwise unaddressed calls untraced.",
